eshape how each run plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss-Driven Progression</strong><br>Every circle ends in a boss fight that forces you to adapt, learn, and improvise under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Retro Pixel Art</strong><br>Punchy, readable, and explosive visuals give the chaos clarity and weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to plunge deeper, fight harder, and swap helmets faster as hell escalates around you. Seven circles stand between you and the Ultimate Lord of the Underworld—gear up, dive in, and bring the pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660600/extras/8623973b537d4b0cfd86da93e96c11b6.webp?t=1785824036\" width=28 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660600/extras/bfa7db42f380d338a2650b89db09ea66.webp?t=1785824036\" width=43 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660600/extras/2cc6d12ab125465a8388781355d3e555.webp?t=1785824036\" width=21 height=15 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660600/extras/b58d04680ac5b04bc125efa236501775.webp?t=1785824036\" width=25 height=16 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660600/extras/8623973b537d4b0cfd86da93e96c11b6.webp?t=1785824036\" width=28 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660600/extras/bfa7db42f380d338a2650b89db09ea66.webp?t=1785824036\" width=43 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" 